{
  "source": "shadcnblocks.com/components category names, fetched 2026-09-22 (classification only; no code, markup or assets used from that site), plus five names taken from shadcn/ui's own component list (ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) on 2026-09-22: Attachment, Bubble, Direction, Marker, Message",
  "note": "Every category is listed, built or not, so the catalog shows the shape of what a rich UI library covers. componentIds map to plugins/acryl-ui/contracts/components.json. Attachment, Bubble, Direction, Marker and Message are shadcn/ui's own component names, added because shadcnblocks' taxonomy has no chat, label-line, text-direction or file-chip category at all - forcing them into Separator, List, File Upload or a similar neighbour would have been a bad match. Both sites render a component only inside a category, so a ported component with no category here would be invisible rather than merely uncategorised.",
